        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The meeting discussed the new project called Thinkbite, which aims to leverage AI to help businesses improve efficiency and profitability.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "9f25bb64-cb9e-4939-83d7-a41a57254179",
                    "time": 106.365,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Manoj Kanal emphasized the importance of having clear use cases for AI implementation, noting that many companies struggle to understand how AI can benefit their business without proper data.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "67afd6ff-c844-41ad-bbaf-5dd98a25a843",
                    "time": 427.41,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Harsha Thota and Bharath MVS presented various AI-driven projects, including process automation and a manufacturing OS, highlighting their potential to optimize operations for smaller companies.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "53cfb2ed-9d22-4b34-820b-41719337526e",
                    "time": 775.715,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "There was a proposal for a partnership where Thinkbite could provide consulting and solutioning services to Manoj's clients, focusing on co-innovation to address specific business problems.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "c7433198-93e5-4b6f-be58-71b00f522b93",
                    "time": 1387.175,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Manoj Kanal agreed to discuss potential use cases with his team and explore how Thinkbite's solutions could be integrated with SAP systems, promising to follow up with Harsha and Bharath.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
