        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Collaboration with Manoj Kanal",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "collaboration_with_manoj_kanal",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Manoj Kanal, CEO and MD of Absolute's GCC, is approached for potential collaboration leveraging his SAP experience to integrate AI solutions. Manoj's expertise could help bridge gap between AI solutions and SAP systems, facilitating adoption and implementation.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "86e9c918-df86-4f8f-a495-a55d73b5786e",
                    "time": 106.365,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Consider co-creating AI solutions with customers to address specific business problems and provide meaningful solutions. Explore becoming strategic partners, offering consulting and solution development services aligned with AI and SAP integration.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "fe230ccc-97e8-4e2b-82a0-f8058f31a574",
                    "time": 495.045,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Difficulty in showcasing AI benefits to customers due to lack of clear use cases and misunderstandings about AI's capabilities. Manoj notes challenges in integrating AI solutions with existing SAP systems and aligning them with customer needs.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "eee27ab8-5aeb-420c-860f-ecb1f26788b7",
