        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Thinkbyte Company Introduction",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "thinkbyte_company_introduction",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Thinkbyte, founded by BITS Pilani graduates, specializes in leveraging AI for business efficiency and value creation. The company aims to generate value for businesses globally by consulting on diverse problems and providing solutions using generative AI.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "45200835-7d26-4034-8579-d96cc92b80e5",
                    "time": 146.5,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Identifying practical AI use cases that deliver genuine business value remains a key challenge. Customers often lack understanding of how AI can benefit their operations, struggling to determine specific use cases for AI implementation.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "e2dcef94-c49b-4703-a0d8-8c6a3ab9ca39",
                    "time": 427.41,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Develop AI solutions for process automation, efficiency improvements, reducing costs, and enhancing P&L. Focus on consulting to identify and address specific business problems with AI-driven solutions.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "981fa82b-8b46-4414-930a-375ae3884f54",
                    "time": 820.23,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "unordered-list",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "thinkbyte_company_introduction",
            "highlight_notes_list": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Generative AI and Custom Solutions",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "generative_ai_and_custom_solutions",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Thinkbyte is leveraging generative AI for process automation, marketing, and business applications, planning to launch a product in the SEO niche. They aim to build a \"marketing copilot\" that evolves into a \"business copilot\" assisting business owners in running their operations.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "5c876f94-80eb-411e-af6a-31f27aebc048",
                    "time": 189.94499,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Develop AI-driven dashboards for non-technical users, and explore new verticals for AI applications to broaden impact across different business functions. Engage in consulting to align AI solutions with specific business goals and challenges.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "297b78e2-a203-481f-90dd-4189b02e7fc6",
                    "time": 253.85501,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Ensuring AI solutions align with specific business needs and deliver tangible efficiency improvements and cost reductions. Many customers express interest in AI without understanding how it applies to their business processes.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "53714c01-3891-403a-97e1-f19b5cd51119",
                    "time": 820.23,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "unordered-list",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "generative_ai_and_custom_solutions",
            "highlight_notes_list": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "AI and Manufacturing OS Development",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "ai_and_manufacturing_os_development",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Thinkbyte is developing a Manufacturing OS to streamline operations by integrating multiple ERP systems, aiming to replace expensive manufacturing execution systems like those from Honeywell or Siemens for smaller companies. This solution targets efficient order booking, shipment handling, and production scheduling.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "aa1298dd-7054-4b99-b7d6-a14ae80b98ec",
                    "time": 332.405,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Focus on creating cost-effective manufacturing execution systems for smaller companies, offering solutions that handle operations from order confirmation to dispatch efficiently. Consider different input sources, including ERP and Excel, to accommodate varying levels of technological adoption.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "1050aeda-3201-4074-9341-9843dac19acf",
                    "time": 332.405,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Integrating AI with SAP systems poses challenges, particularly for companies lacking existing ERP systems. Additionally, creating a cost-effective alternative to expensive manufacturing execution systems requires careful consideration of smaller companies' needs and constraints.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "808ea7bd-1c21-494b-8126-f767f23384d0",
                    "time": 495.045,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "unordered-list",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "ai_and_manufacturing_os_development",
            "highlight_notes_list": true
